  "narrative_text": "On 03/31/2026, at about 20:35, I was driving my 2021 Audi A3 on 8099 Elm Drive, Akron, OH. It was dusk and visibility was reduced. The panels had been rusting and cracking from age for years, and I finally decided to put in a claim for all of the deterioration. I was stopped at a light when another driver failed to brake and hit the rear of my car. No one was hurt and we exchanged insurance information; the police did not attend. The main damage is to the rear body panel, rear reinforcement bar, rear bumper cover. I took the car to Eagle Body & Paint and they estimated the repair at $9,510.00.",
